     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-AU\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Hi,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">On some systems, I find I have to accept the RGTK2 as many as 4 times. Have you tried to load separately.\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><a href=\"http://rattle.togaware.com/rattle-install-mswindows.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rattle.togaware.com/rattle-install-mswindows.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478258401000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1wZJX_AocZEPy5UNnUnyWK\">http://rattle.togaware.com/rattle-install-mswindows.html</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">if you go to the site above site, and try its instruction for an install may help<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Regards<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Tony<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"m_8757126587834163940______replyseparator\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">From:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rattle...@googlegroups.com</a>\r\n [mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rattle...@googlegroups.com</a>] <b>On Behalf Of </b>Roger Loomis<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Friday, 17 March 2017 2:45 AM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> rattle-users<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> unable to load RGtk2.dll Suggestions?<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I am brand new to R and am going through Trever Stephen&#39;s tutorial on Kaggle. He instructed us to install and load rattle, but it isn&#39;t loading properly, apparently because GTK+ isn&#39;t installed properly. When try to load the library, I\r\n get a pop-up window asking, &quot;Need GTK+ ?&quot; and giving me a choice to install or not install GTK+. Whichever I chose, the popup doesn&#39;t go away.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">When I install rattle, it says RGtk2 is also being installed, and that they are both installed successfully. But then when I try to load rattle, it says it can&#39;t find RGtk2.dll. I have verified that the file is in fact in the folder where\r\n it is looking.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">This is in a 64-bit Windows 10 environment.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I copied everything from my console below.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Any suggestions?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all;outline:invert;white-space:pre-wrap!important;word-spacing:0px\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">&gt; </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">install.packages(&#39;rattle&#39;)<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b\">Installing package into ‘C:/Users/LoomisR/Documents/R/win-library/3.3’<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b\">(as ‘lib’ is unspecified)<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b\">also installing the dependency ‘RGtk2’<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;